    "noteZh": "仓库在 master 分支，9 Branches、46 Tags、244 Commits，279 stars、17 forks。最新提交是 refactor: replace icons with generated icon.css (#298)，tests 目录一行写 fix: keep sidebar search state across story navigation (#294)。README 标题 Astrobook，副标题 The minimal UI component playground，正文写 Astrobook is a UI component playground that supports multiple frameworks, including React, Vue, Preact, Svelte, Solid, Lit, and Astro. It offers a unified environment to develop, test, and showcase components.，Try it Online 一节列了多框架混用示例、自定义 head 示例、接进现有 Astro 工程示例以及 TailwindCSS、UnoCSS、PandaCSS 几个示例，线上 demo 在 astrobook.pages.dev。右侧 About 写 Minimal Storybook alternative，标 MIT license。",
